{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"阿摩司书","commonName":"阿摩司书","title":"阿摩司书","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"42c4027397b1c6cfa551ec206eda319190accd30126769b0ef64f13ff07a4bf7","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的毁灭"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"国为列国之首，人最著名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"且为以色列家所归向，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在锡安和撒马利亚山安逸无虑的，有祸了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要过到甲尼察看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从那里往大城哈马去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又下到非利士人的迦特，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看那些国比你们的国还强吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"境界比你们的境界还宽吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们以为降祸的日子还远，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"坐在位上尽行强暴","poem":1},{"noteId":1},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"你们躺卧在象牙床上，舒身在榻上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃群中的羊羔，棚里的牛犊；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"弹琴鼓瑟唱消闲的歌曲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为自己制造乐器，如同大卫所造的；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以大碗喝酒，用上等的油抹身，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却不为约瑟的苦难担忧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以这些人必在被掳的人中首先被掳；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"舒身的人荒宴之乐必消灭了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"主耶和华—万军之 神指着自己起誓说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我憎恶雅各的荣华，厌弃他的宫殿；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我必将城和其中所有的都交付敌人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["那时，若在一房之内剩下十个人，也都必死。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["死人的伯叔，就是烧他尸首的，要将这尸首搬到房外，问房屋内间的人说：「你那里还有人没有？」他必说：「没有」；又说：「不要作声，因为我们不可提耶和华的名。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"看哪，耶和华出令，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大房就被攻破，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"小屋就被打裂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"马岂能在崖石上奔跑？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人岂能在那里用牛耕种呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们却使公平变为苦胆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使公义的果子变为茵 。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们喜爱虚浮的事，自夸说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们不是凭自己的力量取了角吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华、万军之 神说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列家啊，我必兴起一国攻击你们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必欺压你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从哈马口直到亚拉巴的河。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"或译：行强暴使审判临近","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/AMO/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/AMO/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/AMO/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}